        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-hsk5-inference-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "A result and an inference",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "A result connector links an earlier cause to its consequence. An inference connector draws a conclusion from evidence; the evidence must actually support it.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "他每天练习，因而读得更好了。",
                "pinyin": "tā měitiān liànxí ， yīn'ér dú de gèng hǎo le 。",
                "meaning": "He practises every day and consequently reads better.",
                "audio": "c60cba6468de2156d27fb2366dcfa36cdd051f281bdcabfd44b827b01bcf8a12"
              },
              {
                "text": "每个人都来了，可见大家很重视这次活动。",
                "pinyin": "měi gè rén dōu lái le ， kějiàn dàjiā hěn zhòngshì zhè cì huódòng 。",
                "meaning": "Everyone came, which shows they take this event seriously.",
                "audio": "49b59d1d2684afbf89eb876d1b9d0b53958b21b509614a1ae8ed1bb3bb9fd181"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "title": "Words used in this pattern",
            "examples": [
